# TIMETEST.SCRIPT -- TIME and the date (validation Check 14); ERRTEST.BLK on unit 9.
WAIT "Command:"
TYPE "C"
WAIT "Compile what text?"
TYPE "#9:TIMETEST\r"
WAIT "To what codefile?"
TYPE "#9:TIMETEST\r"
WAIT "Smallest available space"
WAIT "Command:"
TYPE "X"
WAIT "Execute what file?"
TYPE "#9:TIMETEST\r"
WAIT "CLOCK"
WAIT "Command:"
